<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50/1.00 up - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50/1.00 up - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts opened</p>
<p>$0.50 to 1.00 higher. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  58.50-59.50, few 58.00 early</p>
<p>Sows: Mostly 1.00 higher. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 43.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 45.00-47.00, few 44.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-49.00</p>
</text>
